732422598", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303100_1066984735755931_8365910092833569499_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_r7Y3dOCjScQ7kNvwEZ7xiL&_nc_oc=Ado0lZxwMJwI29nK5hYwbsSJybIb2JxNV4trHztmxG4JToUjBHOnb02iabMs8HB7gGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIyToYQRb87BUIIZvlcxVceIKa-ZlC2AvdCqgnH1qp2HQ&oe=6AA3EDE5"}, {"file_name": "com.Miles.BlockyGorillas-20260728-111529 (1).png", "id": "1039741792091452", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292329_1039741795424785_1549673424605385306_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uYS8ckLsnygQ7kNvwE1LBPs&_nc_oc=AdqAr-Ca-BbduPgoSqXXgdgOCN1YrdQf0dD70K1OP-eLGZhUSWwuUecSHZBek-JB04s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLarBK1B8IfxKI3Qv93taC3lJbxfVLI8E_0cMinc1q9sw&oe=6AA416E4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blocky Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Blocky Taggers! \ud83e\udd8d\n\nJump into an exciting multiplayer adventure where speed, movement, and strategy are the keys to survival. Climb walls, leap across obstacles, and chase or escape other players in action-packed rounds of tag.\n\nFeatures:\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Smooth movement with climbing and parkour mechanics.\n\ud83c\udf0d Explore unique maps filled with secrets and shortcuts.\n\ud83c\udfa9 Unlock and collect hats, cosmetics, and other fun accessories.\n\ud83d\udc65 Play with friends or meet new players online.\n\ud83d\udd04 Frequent updates with new maps, cosmetics, and game modes.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge yourself to become the ultimate tagger.\n\nWhether you're escaping a chase, pulling off impressive climbs, or showing off your favorite cosmetics, there's always something new to experience in Blocky Taggers.\n\nCan you outrun the competition and become the best tagger?", "short_description": "Swing, climb, and tag your way to victory in Blocky Taggers! Explore colo